## Schema

### Required

- `network_id` (String) Key of the parent layer 2 network, the same value as `vergeio_network.id`. Changing it replaces the assignment.
- `tenant_id` (String) Key of the parent `vergeio_tenant`. Changing it replaces the assignment.

### Optional

- `enabled` (Boolean) Whether the assignment is active. Defaults to true. Changing it updates the assignment in place. Destroy sets this to false before it deletes the row.

### Read-Only

- `id` (String) `tenant_layer2_vnets` key assigned by VergeOS.

## Import

Import is supported using the tenant_layer2_vnets key.

```shell
terraform import vergeio_tenant_layer2_network.example <id>
```
